## 2.1 Seven Fundamental Constraints

| # | Constraint | Impact on Design |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | User must NOT install a local LLM | No Ollama/Llama/Qwen on client. Only tiny ML models bundled with extension |
| 2 | Must work on weak hardware | No NVIDIA GPU assumption. CPU/WASM fallback mandatory |
| 3 | Only lightweight AI runs locally | BlazeFace (~400KB), MobileNet (~5MB), regex, DOM rules |
| 4 | Raw PII must NEVER leave the device | Redaction happens BEFORE any network call |
| 5 | Privacy filtering must be automatic | No "Sanitize" button. Transparent to user |
| 6 | Server reasons ONLY on sanitized context | Server understands `[REDACTED]` tokens |
| 7 | Balance accuracy + resources + latency | Adaptive 3-tier processing based on hardware |

