## 2.6 Demo Scenario (End-to-End)

**Task**: "Help me fill out this signup form"

```
Step 1: User navigates to signup page (name, email, password, phone, profile photo)
Step 2: User presses Ctrl+Shift+V → types "Fill this form with my details"
Step 3: Extension captures screenshot + DOM
Step 4: Tier 1 detects: password (type=password), email (type=email), phone (type=tel)
Step 5: Tier 2 detects: face in profile photo area (BlazeFace)
Step 6: Redaction engine:
        • Blurs face in screenshot
        • Blacks out email/password/phone field content
        • DOM: email → [EMAIL_REDACTED], password → [PASSWORD_REDACTED]
Step 7: Popup shows: "Redacted: 1 face, 1 email, 1 password, 1 phone | 287ms"
Step 8: Sanitized context sent to Groq API (Qwen2.5-VL)
Step 9: Server returns: { "actions": [{"type": "click", "selector": "#name"}],
                          "explanation": "Let's start by clicking the Name field" }
Step 10: Extension highlights #name field with glow, then clicks it
Step 11: Loop: re-capture → re-redact → server says "type 'Recursive Minds' in name"
Step 12: Extension types the text character by character
Step 13: Continue until form is complete
```

